<title>UK: Reuters' 6th ex-UK-Africa air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters' 6th ex-UK-Africa air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-UK air cargo rates to Africa per kg for a 100 kg shipment, with avolume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>	     July 8		    June 5</p>
<p>LON-ACC    0.96			0.97</p>
<p>LON-EBB    1.02			1.00</p>
<p>LON-HRE    1.43			1.45</p>
<p>LON-JNB    1.51			1.55</p>
<p>LON-LBV    2.42			2.50</p>
<p>LON-LOS    1.03			0.97</p>
<p>LON-NBO    0.94			0.96</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents at the three main London airports.</p>
<p>*All prices are quoted in sterling</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity.</p>
<p>-Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706; Fax +5017</p>
<p>www.racs.com</p>
